  "prefLabel": "Fis 403.13 Salmon (Salmo salar)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 403.13 Salmon (Salmo salar). The daily limit for salmon taken in freshwaters of the state shall not exceed 2 fish whether taken from a single waterbody or several waterbodies. More restrictive limits specified in Parts Fis 406 and Fis 407 shall apply to specific waterbodies.\n\nSource. #14418, eff 10-22-25, EXPIRES: 10-22-35",
